{"headword":"חָזַק","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. be</strong> or grow firm, strong, strengthen <strong>(</strong>NH <em>id.;</em> Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܙܰܩ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲזַק</span> <em>bind on</em> or <em>about, gird on</em>, cf. Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">حَزَقَ</span> <em>bind, squeeze</em><strong>)</strong>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:57\" href=\"/Genesis.41.57\">Gn 41:57</a> + 4 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">חָזָק֑</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.15\">2 Ch 26:15</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲזָקוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.20\">2 Ch 28:20</a>, etc.; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶחֱזַק</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.7\">2 Ch 28:7</a> (Baer) + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיֶּחֱזַק</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:56\" href=\"/Genesis.41.56\">Gn 41:56</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶחֶזְקוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10:11\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10.11\">2 S 10:11</a> + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶחְזְקוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.22\">Is 28:22</a>; Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲזַק</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 12:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.12.23\">Dt 12:23</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">חִזְקוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 31:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.31.6\">Dt 31:6</a> +; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְחָזְקָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.13\">2 K 12:13</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְחָזְקָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 30:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.30.21\">Ez 30:21</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">חָזֵק</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 19:19\" href=\"/Exodus.19.19\">Ex 19:19</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.1\">2 S 3:1</a>, etc.;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"intrans. <em>be</em> or <em>grow strong:</em>—"},{"senses":[{"senses":[{"definition":"of physical strength of hands <a data-ref=\"Ju